message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Duty of Care to NYSC Corps Members in an Era of Insecurity"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Badmus
    given-names: Malik
    affiliation: "University of Ilorin (BSc Sociology)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikbadmus79-max/nysc-duty-of-care"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered assessment of how far the rules and resources of the
  National Youth Service Corps (NYSC) protect corps members from kidnapping
  and other serious harm: a duty-of-care policy audit, an incident register
  for 2010 to 2026, exposure-adjusted risk by state, and a budget audit for
  2018 to 2026.
keywords:
  - NYSC
  - Nigeria
  - duty of care
  - kidnapping
  - public policy
  - insecurity
